LIMITATION: rows are not strictly independent observations -- peak-level m6A values are broadcast to multiple transcripts of the same gene (2,143 repeated ENSTs, 3,280 duplicated (ENST, ENSG) pairs, 3,117 genes behind 12,754 rows), so the chi-square null distribution is optimistic about the effective sample size; unit-of-analysis sensitivity values are reported in section 6.
